29ab0095d3f7cfc5806b14.mp4?t=1761855801\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Summary</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After an alien invasion of planet Earth, the planet is left in a dangerous state with many bio-mutants haunting the planet. With you as the last remaining human, you search the map looking for weapons and armor. You fight bio-mutants and collect Aura to upgrade your bunker and possibly escape...</p>", "short_description": "Escape a post-apocalyptic Earth colonized by a highly-intelligent alien species. Fight alien bosses, nitro-mutants, unlock classes, and explore dangerous biomes in a vast open world. Red Land is a rogue-lite, high risk, high reward game. Will you escape... or not?", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French<strong>*</strong>, Italian<strong>*</strong>, German<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain<strong>*</strong>, Czech<strong>*</strong>, Japanese<strong>*</strong>, Korean<strong>*</strong>, Polish<strong>*</strong>, Portuguese - Brazil<strong>*</strong>, Portuguese - Portugal<strong>*</strong>, Russian<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573990/6f848397051cb7c7098baf3868b92792a2d00e0f/header.jpg?t=1761855801", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573990/194ebb73bdf21f59cf62dfcff7955d29e8a960bb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761855801", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573990/194ebb73bdf21f59cf62dfcff7955d29e8a960bb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761855801", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7/8/10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 6 GB 